<resources>

    <!--
      Build 105: use the beryl (A16) QTI phone app stack with the matching
      IMS JNI libraries against the alioth HIDL vendor radio.

      The A15 QtiTelephony predates the A17 extphonelib IExtPhone.queryNrIcon
      method and crashed with AbstractMethodError. The beryl QtiTelephony
      implements that method and still has the HIDL QtiRadio/QtiRadioConfig
      fallback needed by this vendor tree.

      The A15 ims.apk also crashed in JNI_OnLoad because it was paired with
      the A17 QSSI libimsmedia_jni.so. The beryl ims.apk is now paired with the
      matching beryl libimsmedia_jni/lib-imsvt libraries.

      The device manifest intentionally has no AIDL IMS/QTI entries; the
      vendor provides HIDL IImsRadio 1.7, IQtiRadio 2.6, IQcRilAudio and
      qcrilhook services.
    -->
    <string name="config_ims_mmtel_package" translatable="false">org.codeaurora.ims</string>
    <string name="config_ims_rcs_package" translatable="false">org.codeaurora.ims</string>

</resources>
